  "description": "Profanity Filter is a bad word filter API that scans text for offensive language and masks detected swear words with a chosen replacement character. It returns the sanitized text and a boolean flag indicating if profanity was present. Paid plans add the count of filtered words, each matched word with its position, and custom allow and block word lists.",
